# Android signing material and local build configuration
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
android/signing.properties
# Auto-provisioned credential-encryption key (lib/credCrypto ensureCredKey) — server-only,
# must never be committed. Survives redeploys on the box; regenerating it makes existing
# encrypted branch passwords unreadable (they just need a one-time Reset).
.cred_key

